WEBVTT

00:00:03.630 --> 00:00:05.000
For the finishing touch...

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:09.830
I'll add this decoration here...

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:13.460
...and it's done!

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.580
Lordy me, look at all this hullabaloo.

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:21.960
The spirits of the dead are gonna
be flying out of their graves in joy

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:24.750
after they see all these
extravagant decorations.

00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:28.250
What am I gonna do if that
old geezer shows up to haunt me?

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:30.290
Oh Heaven forbid!

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:38.640
Magic Set
ABRACADABRA

00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:38.250
This goes here first, then I do this and...

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:39.580
...ta-dah!

00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:42.330
Huh?! What happened?

00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:44.780
This is hard.

00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:46.940
Okay! One more try!

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:50.290
I'm totally gonna get this
down before Halloween!

00:00:50.290 --> 00:00:51.380
Cocoa!

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:54.750
Hey! We're opening the cafe!

00:00:55.380 --> 00:00:58.330
Okay! I'm on my way now!

00:01:03.460 --> 00:01:07.040
Kuruntto hitomawari hora dance dance

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:10.130
Tenkuu cafeteria de dance dance

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:12.790
Door wa doko? (Kocchi!)

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.460
Cup no naka e pyon (Tobikonjatte!)

00:01:16.670 --> 00:01:19.630
Osora ni ukabeta mokomoko na kumo

00:01:19.790 --> 00:01:23.000
Jitsu wa ne amai no honto ni (uso desu!)

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:26.080
Osora ni tea cup to coffee cup tonjaeba

00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:28.710
Dokodemo ikemasu ne isshoni

00:01:29.330 --> 00:01:35.210
Itsumademo yume miteitaitte
(Arieru koto yori arienai koto)

00:01:35.380 --> 00:01:41.210
Kangaete ashita ni tokimeite
(Shiritai aji ga ippai desu)

00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:43.920
Sugar yori cinnamon ga

00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:47.830
Ki ni nari dashitara shinka no toki kamo

00:01:47.960 --> 00:01:51.210
Atarashii basho ni (Yobareta?)

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:54.250
Yobaretara omoikitte tobimashou

00:01:54.250 --> 00:01:57.250
(Notte notte tea cup de gungun sora tobeba)

00:01:57.250 --> 00:01:59.460
(Notte notte coffee cup hai hai)

00:01:59.460 --> 00:02:03.210
Kuruntto hitomawari hora
dance dance (Dance dance!)

00:02:03.210 --> 00:02:06.460
Tenkuu cafeteria de dance
dance (Dance dance!)

00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:10.130
Door wa doko? Cup no naka desu

00:02:10.290 --> 00:02:12.710
Mousou? Genjitsu? Docchi?

00:02:12.710 --> 00:02:15.750
Docchidemo iinjanai kana (sokka)

00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:19.080
Atama ni whip sarechatte (Fuwa fuwa)

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:25.000
Saa odottara (Mirai wa) kitto
tanoshii kara (tonjaimasuka!)

00:02:25.330 --> 00:02:28.250
Osora ni tea cup to coffee cup tonjatte

00:02:28.380 --> 00:02:31.380
Dokodemo ikemasu ne isshoni!

00:02:35.330 --> 00:02:38.830
Trick or Treat! Gimme candy!

00:02:39.330 --> 00:02:40.510
Hiss!

00:02:40.830 --> 00:02:43.800
Fork it over or I eat you instead!

00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:45.720
Grrrr!

00:02:46.130 --> 00:02:47.930
We're all decked out for Halloween, too!

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:50.170
Vampires aren't easy to beat, you know!

00:02:50.830 --> 00:02:53.830
If you want candy, then you
have to let me cuddle you!

00:02:53.830 --> 00:02:55.900
She's not after our blood?!
Fluffy, fluffy, fluffy...

00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:57.880
What kind of vampire are you?

00:02:57.880 --> 00:02:59.330
Chino...

00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:01.570
I vant to suck your blood, blah!

00:03:01.960 --> 00:03:05.110
Staff aren't expected
to act while in costume.

00:03:05.110 --> 00:03:07.080
Oh? But yesterday...

00:03:09.880 --> 00:03:11.130
Roar.

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:13.540
Roar...!

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:17.570
Wait, what do vampires even sound like?

00:03:17.570 --> 00:03:19.340
You saw me?!

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:22.090
She's gone cannibal!

00:03:22.090 --> 00:03:24.290
No fair!

00:03:24.750 --> 00:03:28.710
Well, we're off to get more candy
from Fleur and Ama Usa.

00:03:28.710 --> 00:03:30.250
You're really raring to go!

00:03:30.250 --> 00:03:32.290
Yeah, events like this should
be enjoyed to their fullest!

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:37.830
Trick or Treat!

00:03:38.170 --> 00:03:40.170
Welcome in, Mame.

00:03:40.170 --> 00:03:41.710
It's Red Riding Hood!

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:44.820
Give us candy or we're gonna eat you!

00:03:46.040 --> 00:03:47.580
Sure. Here you go.

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:49.000
Thank you!

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:53.200
Things sure do get busy
around holidays like this.

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:55.130
It must be tiring work.

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:58.440
But the pay is good.

00:03:58.440 --> 00:04:00.580
Especially since things
have been tight lately...

00:04:03.460 --> 00:04:05.210
Put your hand out, Syaro.

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:09.390
We've got a treat for you, too.

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:11.600
Consider this a little bonus.

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:13.460
Thanks, Mame.

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:17.250
Candy is great and all, but
I really wanna eat meat!

00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:18.580
She's not Red Riding Hood!

00:04:18.580 --> 00:04:19.980
She's the wolf!

00:04:22.130 --> 00:04:24.500
Welcome to the Witches' Magic Manor.

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:31.120
AMA USA AN

00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:26.170
Huh? What?

00:04:26.250 --> 00:04:28.330
I thought this was a Japanese
confectionary cafe...

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:30.920
The witches' sabbath is about to begin.

00:04:33.380 --> 00:04:37.600
"A Pitch-Black Banquet of
Vile Demons and Rabbits"?

00:04:37.600 --> 00:04:41.000
The menu is even more wacky
and confusing than usual.

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:42.960
Here is your tea.

00:04:44.630 --> 00:04:45.170
Chiya?!

00:04:45.170 --> 00:04:47.170
Wh-what's wrong?!

00:04:48.290 --> 00:04:51.080
My left hand... it's throbbing...

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:52.780
Her acting is top notch!

00:04:52.780 --> 00:04:55.210
Ama Usa is definitely the
most elaborate on Halloween!

00:04:56.500 --> 00:04:57.630
No, that's not it.

00:04:57.960 --> 00:05:01.580
I seriously hurt my hand!
I was a little clumsy.

00:05:02.130 --> 00:05:04.170
Then shouldn't you be taking the day off?

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:04.990
I can't.

00:05:05.380 --> 00:05:08.370
Not when so many customers are coming
with high expectations!

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:09.790
I want to do my best!

00:05:09.790 --> 00:05:11.120
Ouch, ouch...

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:13.420
You really should take a break.

00:05:13.420 --> 00:05:14.580
I'm fine.

00:05:14.880 --> 00:05:17.380
My grandma and Anko are here to help me.

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:18.960
Hey, Megu...

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:21.000
Yeah. Let's do it, Maya!

00:05:23.510 --> 00:05:26.580
Madam Chiya, we will become
your loyal familiars!

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:29.010
PACT                                                                   FORMED

00:05:26.580 --> 00:05:28.540
Consider this our pact!

00:05:30.960 --> 00:05:34.240
Forming a pact with a witch requires
offering your very soul.

00:05:34.240 --> 00:05:38.030
Thou art now completely under mine control!

00:05:38.030 --> 00:05:39.560
That was fast!

00:05:42.520 --> 00:05:46.880
Here you are! Your Tower of Moonlight
and Pumpkins has been summoned!

00:05:46.880 --> 00:05:49.910
Give me a bite in exchange
for my summoning services, okay?

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:51.670
That's perfect!

00:05:51.670 --> 00:05:53.920
Your familiar level has gone up by one!

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:57.710
Gotta give off the right
vibe to fill the role!

00:05:57.710 --> 00:05:58.750
Meow!

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:01.170
Huh? I thought these were
supposed to be werewolf costumes.

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:03.200
What? I thought we were cats!

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:04.920
I thought you were dogs!

00:06:05.290 --> 00:06:07.170
Well, it doesn't really matter.

00:06:07.170 --> 00:06:10.330
I'll do my best to become
an impressive fox demon.

00:06:10.330 --> 00:06:13.260
You guys don't understand
your own characters?

00:06:14.580 --> 00:06:22.500
WITCH
BACKSTORY
RECORDS

00:06:14.830 --> 00:06:18.380
You need to have a fleshed-out backstory
for this to work properly!

00:06:18.380 --> 00:06:20.080
Witch backstory record books?!

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:22.170
Did you write all of those?!

00:06:25.460 --> 00:06:28.670
The Vampiric King with a
Pumpkin Head has arrived!

00:06:28.670 --> 00:06:30.500
Become his underling!

00:06:30.880 --> 00:06:32.290
And enjoy!

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:35.000
Your familiar level has gone up by two!

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:36.170
Hooray!

00:06:36.170 --> 00:06:38.080
Wait, Megu got more points than me?!

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:42.670
But why?! She's an angel at heart
that's only pretending to be a demon!

00:06:42.670 --> 00:06:44.090
Huh? Isn't that actually a compliment?!

00:06:44.090 --> 00:06:48.630
If that makes you mad, then just try putting those
actual fangs of yours to use!

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:49.970
She fought back!

00:06:49.970 --> 00:06:53.500
A familiar of Madam Chiya
should at least know how to bite!

00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:56.470
Fine then! I'll show you just
how sharp my fangs can be!

00:06:56.470 --> 00:06:58.250
Go on, I dare you!

00:06:57.580 --> 00:07:01.210
Uh oh, things have gotten out of hand
because I randomly assigned them points...

00:06:58.250 --> 00:07:01.210
Prepare for a bite like
you've never felt before!

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:06.080
S-stop fighting and I'll give you some candy!

00:07:06.420 --> 00:07:07.920
Our plan worked!

00:07:07.920 --> 00:07:08.630
Huh?

00:07:09.130 --> 00:07:12.410
You still hadn't given us a treat,
so we pulled a trick on you!

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:14.960
I see...

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:19.640
It seems that my mischievous little familiars
will need to be punished.

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:22.250
We've incurred the witch's wrath!

00:07:24.920 --> 00:07:28.920
WE ARE CLOSED

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:28.750
Thanks so much for your help, you two.

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:31.790
Please help yourselves to some pumpkin tarts.

00:07:32.290 --> 00:07:33.920
They're my grandmother's speciality!

00:07:33.920 --> 00:07:36.040
Thanks for the treat!

00:07:36.040 --> 00:07:37.630
One of them is laced with wasabi.

00:07:37.630 --> 00:07:39.640
So it's Russian roulette?!

00:07:39.640 --> 00:07:41.920
Wh-which one has the wasabi...?

00:07:42.630 --> 00:07:44.420
I hope I don't pick it...

00:07:47.630 --> 00:07:48.540
This one's mine.

00:07:49.040 --> 00:07:50.030
I'll try this one.

00:07:52.580 --> 00:07:54.290
I'm totally pulling your leg!

00:07:54.290 --> 00:07:55.040
Huh?

00:07:55.460 --> 00:07:57.520
There's no wasabi in any of them.

00:07:57.520 --> 00:08:01.080
Today was a lot of fun! Thank you!

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:02.540
Chiya...

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:04.170
Madam Chiya...

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:06.600
Go on, eat up!

00:08:06.600 --> 00:08:07.420
Okay!

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:10.080
I filled two of 'em up
with wasabi, by the way!

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:10.670
Huh?!

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:12.630
There's an actual witch here!

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:15.460
She got the wasabi!

00:08:17.790 --> 00:08:20.930
You don't have to walk us home.

00:08:21.210 --> 00:08:23.580
It's okay, I was going out shopping anyway.

00:08:24.290 --> 00:08:27.080
Rabbit House and Fleur were
also going all out this year.

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:29.170
Aren't you going to stop by?

00:08:29.710 --> 00:08:31.820
I don't want to interrupt when they're busy.

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:34.570
Maybe everybody else feels the same way.

00:08:34.960 --> 00:08:38.330
But Chiya managed to summon us,
so I'm sure they'll show up!

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:39.380
Yeah!

00:08:39.960 --> 00:08:42.830
Can that really be called "summoning"?

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:45.820
We're heading this way.

00:08:45.820 --> 00:08:47.420
See you later!

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:48.630
Bye bye!

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:52.380
Ouchies...

00:08:53.920 --> 00:08:55.380
Good work today.

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:57.040
Bye bye!

00:08:57.040 --> 00:08:58.410
Be careful!

00:08:58.410 --> 00:09:00.130
Okay, see you tomorrow.

00:09:06.710 --> 00:09:07.950
Chiya?

00:09:07.950 --> 00:09:09.670
Oh, Rize.

00:09:10.330 --> 00:09:13.010
Did you hurt your wrist? Let me help you!

00:09:13.010 --> 00:09:15.360
Huh? B-but...

00:09:15.630 --> 00:09:18.040
I was just in the mood to
carry around some pumpkins.

00:09:18.040 --> 00:09:19.490
How is that a mood?!

00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:20.830
Just c'mon!

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:28.000
WE ARE CLOSED

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:27.210
Syaro?

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:31.130
What's wrong? Did you lose your house key?

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:32.750
No!

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:34.500
I brought some really good medicine.

00:09:34.500 --> 00:09:36.170
Your grandma said you were hurt.

00:09:36.170 --> 00:09:37.890
It's hardly a scratch...

00:09:37.890 --> 00:09:43.560
Don't give me that. You babied me
like there was no tomorrow when I caught a little cold.

00:09:43.560 --> 00:09:44.790
Thank you!

00:09:46.310 --> 00:09:49.480
Say, would you be interested
in having dinner together?

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:51.080
I'll cook!

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:52.190
With your injured hand?!

00:09:52.190 --> 00:09:54.290
Chiya, you need to relax!

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:55.710
I'll do the cooking!

00:09:55.710 --> 00:09:57.580
I've got some really tasty meat.

00:09:57.580 --> 00:09:58.740
Meat?!

00:09:58.740 --> 00:10:00.880
And for desert, pumpkin tarts!

00:10:00.880 --> 00:10:03.120
But one of them as wasabi in it.

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:04.290
Wasabi?!

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:06.330
There's a 33% chance you get it.

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:21.380
I ran into Rize and Syaro yesterday
after you two went home.

00:10:21.920 --> 00:10:24.750
I guess all that "summoning"
talk was a good luck charm.

00:10:24.750 --> 00:10:27.000
So you really did summon them!

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:31.170
If we combined our powers together,
we may be able to summon something even greater!

00:10:31.170 --> 00:10:32.710
No way!

00:10:33.790 --> 00:10:35.250
Shall we give it a try?

00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:36.130
Huh?!

00:10:43.130 --> 00:10:46.130
Heed now the prayer of these souls,

00:10:46.130 --> 00:10:50.870
and to this chaotic realm bring forth
the king of all darkness!

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:54.460
On this eve, we offer up to you...

00:10:54.960 --> 00:10:55.790
our 4 souls!

00:10:56.880 --> 00:10:57.920
Come forth!

00:10:58.330 --> 00:11:00.510
Emissary of Hell!

00:11:00.510 --> 00:11:02.580
Trick or Treat!

00:11:02.580 --> 00:11:03.380
The summoning worked!

00:11:03.380 --> 00:11:04.040
Amazing!

00:11:04.040 --> 00:11:05.890
Huh? Maya and Megu?

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:08.540
I didn't think anything
would actually happen!

00:11:11.250 --> 00:11:12.150
Here!

00:11:12.420 --> 00:11:15.770
We wanted you to try our
newest sweet creation!

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:17.040
Thank you!

00:11:17.040 --> 00:11:22.040
I was also hoping to have you try my
"Advent of the Vampiric King," Cocoa!

00:11:22.040 --> 00:11:24.420
I have no idea what that is, but thank you!

00:11:24.790 --> 00:11:27.290
The witch and the vampire are cohorts!

00:11:27.290 --> 00:11:30.090
But I'm not giving out any treats
without some cuddles first!

00:11:30.090 --> 00:11:31.580
Surprise attack!

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:32.670
Blah!

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:33.880
Don't make us laugh!

00:11:33.880 --> 00:11:35.290
We'll take you down with ease!

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:36.670
As the new "Chimame Corps"!

00:11:37.210 --> 00:11:38.170
NEW CHIMAME CORPS

00:11:39.130 --> 00:11:40.380
"Chimame"...

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:42.630
But what about me?!

00:11:43.170 --> 00:11:45.080
Our attack was super effective!

00:11:46.420 --> 00:11:48.270
I'm seriously going to prank all of you!

00:11:48.270 --> 00:11:53.080
Hiss!

00:11:49.580 --> 00:11:51.750
Eek! She's out of control!

00:11:54.330 --> 00:11:56.500
Mame can be so mean sometimes.

00:11:56.500 --> 00:12:00.500
But don't worry, the "Chi" of "ChiMaMe"
will always stand for Chino.

00:12:00.500 --> 00:12:03.200
Okay, thanks, big sister Chiya.

00:12:05.540 --> 00:12:07.500
Now that was super effective.

00:12:07.500 --> 00:12:09.950
We should really do something
to calm her down...

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:13.710
Cocoa! Come over here!

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:18.920
Jeez! I hereby sentence you
two to death by cuddling!

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:22.580
Oy vey...

00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:27.010
Bunnisode 7:
We Shall Dance with Ghosts Until Morning
on this Halloween Night!

00:12:55.670 --> 00:12:59.540
I've been so excited about dressing up
as Phantom Thief Lapin, but I hope I don't look weird...

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:01.290
Hold it, Phantom Thief.

00:13:02.040 --> 00:13:03.380
You're under arrest!

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:05.180
Inspector Rize?!

00:13:05.180 --> 00:13:06.830
That outfit looks great on you!

00:13:07.170 --> 00:13:09.420
Th-thank you.

00:13:09.420 --> 00:13:11.210
Sorry to keep you!

00:13:11.210 --> 00:13:11.930
It's Chiya!

00:13:13.960 --> 00:13:15.800
She's doing Lapin too, huh?

00:13:15.800 --> 00:13:17.250
We copied each other...

00:13:17.250 --> 00:13:18.710
Senpai!

00:13:18.710 --> 00:13:20.920
Sorry I'm late!

00:13:20.920 --> 00:13:21.440
Syaro!

00:13:21.960 --> 00:13:24.190
Why is everybody dressed as Lapin?!

00:13:24.190 --> 00:13:26.130
I'm saving money by not
buying a new costume...

00:13:26.130 --> 00:13:29.300
We wanted to try wearing it for once! Right?

00:13:29.300 --> 00:13:30.280
Yes.

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:34.910
Well, that's basically Syaro's usual work outfit.
I was hoping to see her in something else.

00:13:36.420 --> 00:13:39.830
W-well, I think that you should
be Lapin instead, Senpai!

00:13:39.830 --> 00:13:41.790
W-why do you want me to?

00:13:41.790 --> 00:13:46.380
Halloween is supposed to be a special day
when the spirits of the dead return here, right?

00:13:46.380 --> 00:13:50.210
Yeah, people dress up as demons and ghosts
to blend in with them.

00:13:50.210 --> 00:13:52.380
Although anything goes these days.

00:13:52.750 --> 00:13:58.380
Then I think out of all of us, Cocoa might have
the costume that fits best with that tradition.

00:13:58.380 --> 00:14:00.630
What did Cocoa dress up as?

00:14:02.580 --> 00:14:04.130
A magician.

00:14:12.920 --> 00:14:14.170
I'm lost.

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:18.790
This is the same old town,
but somehow it looks different today.

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:20.330
I feel like I'm in another world!

00:14:21.250 --> 00:14:24.210
Anyways, I need to hurry
and find Chino and Tippy!

00:14:28.500 --> 00:14:30.040
A-are you okay?

00:14:30.040 --> 00:14:32.630
Um... are you lost?

00:14:39.670 --> 00:14:41.670
I'm also looking for some girls who are lost.

00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:43.330
Four of them, in fact!

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:47.460
You just let me handle everything!

00:14:50.500 --> 00:14:52.960
Keep your eyes on this magic wand.

00:14:53.290 --> 00:14:54.830
Flowers will... guh!

00:14:58.330 --> 00:15:01.170
Th-then, let me try a different spell
to summon some candy!

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:09.000
There you are! Come over here!

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:11.500
Mommy!

00:15:12.880 --> 00:15:15.920
What kind of magic was
that?! You totally suck!

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:41.460
Who are you? A magician?

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:46.040
My wand...

00:15:54.880 --> 00:15:56.250
I found Tippy!

00:15:56.880 --> 00:15:57.540
Huh?

00:15:58.040 --> 00:16:00.790
But those eyes seem different somehow...

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:03.290
They look more like those of a young lady.

00:16:04.330 --> 00:16:06.040
I must have the wrong rabbit.

00:16:06.040 --> 00:16:06.670
Ow!

00:16:07.960 --> 00:16:11.530
She made me think that no more candy
would come out, but it was actually a feint...

00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:12.750
I could do that!

00:16:13.920 --> 00:16:16.920
Um! Please tell me how you did that trick!

00:16:16.920 --> 00:16:19.210
I want to impress my little sisters!

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:24.580
Huh? You want me to pay you?!

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:27.420
Wait, "okay"?!

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:29.920
Jeez, so you just made the wrong gesture!

00:16:34.170 --> 00:16:36.130
Cocoa isn't answering her phone.

00:16:36.130 --> 00:16:37.710
I wonder what happened?

00:16:38.080 --> 00:16:39.310
Let's go find her!

00:16:39.830 --> 00:16:42.130
Cocoa is the loot that
we're aiming for tonight!

00:16:42.130 --> 00:16:44.170
I see that you two swapped your costumes.

00:16:44.750 --> 00:16:45.540
Hold on.

00:16:45.960 --> 00:16:48.840
That loot is mine alone for the taking.

00:16:48.840 --> 00:16:52.040
The one who catches Cocoa is the real Lapin!

00:16:52.040 --> 00:16:55.570
I'm competing with the two of you? So be it.

00:16:55.570 --> 00:16:59.080
Hey! That's not the kind of stuff Lapin says!

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:00.330
Uh oh, the inspector is here!

00:17:00.960 --> 00:17:03.670
Come on! We're going to
search for Cocoa together.

00:17:03.670 --> 00:17:06.170
And when we find her, she'll
be under arrest, too!

00:17:08.710 --> 00:17:12.420
But it's gonna be hard to find her
with everybody in town dressed up.

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:13.340
Free treats!

00:17:15.290 --> 00:17:18.000
B-big sister Cocoa!

00:17:18.960 --> 00:17:21.920
I thought Cocoa might react
to hearing something like that...

00:17:21.920 --> 00:17:22.810
Good idea!

00:17:22.810 --> 00:17:24.600
Let's split up!

00:17:24.830 --> 00:17:27.190
B-big sister?

00:17:27.190 --> 00:17:29.070
Yo, sista!

00:17:29.070 --> 00:17:30.940
Oh, sissy!

00:17:31.250 --> 00:17:33.960
I swear, if this is enough
to actually attract Cocoa...

00:17:34.830 --> 00:17:36.210
C'mon, you gotta do it, too!

00:17:36.210 --> 00:17:37.770
Uh, sure.

00:17:37.770 --> 00:17:40.790
B-big sister Cocoa...

00:17:40.790 --> 00:17:42.420
You gotta be louder than that!

00:17:42.420 --> 00:17:44.330
Remember all the training
we did for your recital!

00:17:47.420 --> 00:17:49.960
Big sister Cocoa!

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:53.580
I hear somebody calling!

00:17:55.220 --> 00:17:56.830
Hey, sista!
Big sister!
Sissy!

00:17:56.830 --> 00:17:59.190
Where are you?

00:17:57.500 --> 00:17:59.130
Big sister Cocoa!

00:17:59.190 --> 00:18:01.920
Big sister Cocoa!

00:18:12.710 --> 00:18:13.750
What's up?

00:18:14.880 --> 00:18:16.080
Nothing.

00:18:22.130 --> 00:18:22.710
Ta-dah!

00:18:23.130 --> 00:18:25.040
Wow, I did it!

00:18:34.630 --> 00:18:35.790
"Bye bye"?

00:18:40.080 --> 00:18:43.420
Whoa! Vanishing magic! That's amazing!

00:18:43.420 --> 00:18:45.460
Cocoa!

00:18:48.130 --> 00:18:49.460
Tippy!

00:18:51.040 --> 00:18:55.000
I'd know these refined facial features
and fluff anywhere! It's definitely Tippy!

00:18:55.710 --> 00:18:57.420
And this weird voice!

00:18:57.420 --> 00:18:58.920
B-but...

00:18:59.460 --> 00:19:01.420
Who called my name just now?

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:05.110
Don't tell me it was a ghost!

00:19:05.110 --> 00:19:07.210
We found her! There's our loot!

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:09.080
You're not getting away!

00:19:09.080 --> 00:19:11.040
The Phantom Thief Lapin is here!

00:19:11.040 --> 00:19:12.750
A hoard of Lapins?!

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:16.960
I touched her first!

00:19:16.960 --> 00:19:18.920
Well, I made eye contact with her first!

00:19:18.920 --> 00:19:21.590
The real Lapin waits until the very end
to steal the loot away!

00:19:21.590 --> 00:19:25.630
Oh please, you're embarrassing me
with all this "loot" talk.

00:19:25.630 --> 00:19:27.460
Don't fight over little ol' me.

00:19:28.460 --> 00:19:29.130
Huh?!

00:19:29.130 --> 00:19:31.100
You're under arrest for the crime
of causing major distress!

00:19:31.100 --> 00:19:36.250
Honestly, I can't believe you got lost.
You never change, Cocoa.

00:19:36.250 --> 00:19:37.880
You'll have to give us
treats to make up for it.

00:19:38.460 --> 00:19:40.960
I'm so sorry!

00:19:45.130 --> 00:19:46.670
What's wrong?

00:19:46.670 --> 00:19:49.460
I was just thinking that I never
got a chance to say thanks...

00:19:50.170 --> 00:19:51.540
To who?

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:53.790
I'm not sure...

00:19:54.670 --> 00:19:55.960
Who was that?

00:19:59.130 --> 00:20:00.830
That was so fun!

00:20:00.830 --> 00:20:03.260
Another Halloween comes to an end.

00:20:03.260 --> 00:20:06.080
The souls of our ancestors
must be headed back for the heavens.

00:20:17.500 --> 00:20:19.170
Don't worry.

00:20:20.170 --> 00:20:23.960
The pearly gates still haven't
opened up for me yet.

00:20:31.460 --> 00:20:32.710
Chino!

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:36.590
Let me show you the newest
magic that I've learned!

00:20:36.590 --> 00:20:38.210
Huh? Magic?

00:20:41.330 --> 00:20:44.580
Ta-dah! Hm? Did I surprise you so much
that you clammed up?

00:20:44.580 --> 00:20:45.750
Hooray!

00:20:47.460 --> 00:20:48.460
No...

00:20:52.920 --> 00:20:53.830
Chino.

00:20:54.380 --> 00:20:56.500
Okay, watch closely now.

00:21:00.040 --> 00:21:00.830
Here!

00:21:05.170 --> 00:21:07.700
This trick always puts a big
smile on your face, huh?

00:21:20.330 --> 00:21:23.750
It's just that my mother was always good
at doing that particular trick.

00:21:27.750 --> 00:21:29.790
Hey! We're gonna leave you behind!

00:21:30.790 --> 00:21:31.470
Let's go!

00:21:38.130 --> 00:21:40.960
So, tell me more about your mom!

00:21:40.960 --> 00:21:41.920
Huh?

00:21:41.920 --> 00:21:44.340
What other magic tricks was she good at?

00:21:44.340 --> 00:21:45.670
What kind of person was she?

00:21:45.670 --> 00:21:46.990
Did she like fluffy things?!

00:21:46.990 --> 00:21:50.830
Either ask me questions or run! Not both!

00:21:56.540 --> 00:21:58.710
Nakayoshi da zutto da!

00:21:58.710 --> 00:22:00.500
Nakayoshi! Maru! Nakayoshi!

00:22:00.670 --> 00:22:04.040
Kimecchaimasu Maru desukara mondai nai!!

00:22:04.040 --> 00:22:07.880
Kono sekai ni wa fushigi ga aru to

00:22:08.000 --> 00:22:11.670
Minareta mado kara osasoi no message

00:22:11.920 --> 00:22:15.710
Ironna toko e dekakemasen ka?

00:22:15.710 --> 00:22:19.420
Hai hai tama ni wa bouken mo hitsuyou desu ne

00:22:19.670 --> 00:22:23.290
Soshite soshite tooi machikado de kitto

00:22:23.580 --> 00:22:27.420
Itsumo no coffee nomitaku naru hazu

00:22:27.420 --> 00:22:33.420
Hanarete mite wakaru koto ga takusan aru

00:22:35.540 --> 00:22:36.960
Yappari...

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:40.750
Ima wa issho ga ii ne zutto issho ga ii ne

00:22:41.000 --> 00:22:44.540
Kawatteku kisetsu no naka demo

00:22:44.750 --> 00:22:48.540
Onaji kimochi de itai minna o daiji ni shitai

00:22:48.750 --> 00:22:52.580
Daisuki na basho ga atte yokatta

00:22:52.750 --> 00:22:56.460
Ima wa issho ga ii ne sou da issho ga ii ne

00:22:56.580 --> 00:23:00.130
Dokoka ittemo chanto modotte kite

00:23:00.130 --> 00:23:02.210
Tsutawatteru ki ga shimasu

00:23:02.210 --> 00:23:07.540
Datte datte hora kyou mo minna ni aemashita

00:23:07.960 --> 00:23:13.960
Aitai toki ni aerutte... nakayoshi!

00:23:16.130 --> 00:23:18.000
Nakayoshi da zutto da!

00:23:18.000 --> 00:23:19.500
Nakayoshi! Maru! Nakayoshi!

00:23:19.880 --> 00:23:23.750
Kimecchaimasu Maru desukara mondai nai!!

00:23:27.040 --> 00:23:29.960
Perhaps I'll play some jazz
for once this evening.

00:23:30.880 --> 00:23:33.170
I really hope that you're
out there listening.

00:23:32.880 --> 00:23:36.040
Bunnisode 8: Stamp, Sleep, Study, Smile

00:23:34.080 --> 00:23:35.710
Okay, Saki?
